        <activityName xml:lang="en">Dismantling, shredder fraction from manual dismantling, mechanically, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Dismantling, shredder fraction from manual dismantling, mechanically, at plant
shredding/separation procedure, based on common transfer coefficients. Data from literature and from own experiences in Switzerland. 2023 updates are implemented for the shredder energy consumption; UUID: 1f315f2e-2ec7-4d50-a8e9-04a9d2614fb2
This dataset represents the mechanical treatment (shredder) of material from manual dismantling that cannot be further dismantled manually.
Location: European data, used as average for global situation
Technology: 4-step-procedure (shredder - separation - shredder - separation) as used currently often in Europe
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unkonwn
Sampling: literature and own experiences
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1f315f2e-2ec7-4d50-a8e9-04a9d2614fb2.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
